<title>USA: Marks Brothers Jewelers Inc Q1 shr $0.05.</title>
<headline>Marks Brothers Jewelers Inc Q1 shr $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marks Bros. Jewelers Inc</p>
<p>				  Statements of Operations</p>
<p>	     for the three months ended April 30, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>					 (unaudited)</p>
<p>		     (in thousands, except for per share data)</p>
<p>							1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				   $  34,714   $ 29,560</p>
<p>   Income from operations		    1,809	1,608</p>
<p>   Net income (loss)			     540	(858)</p>
<p>   Net income (loss) per share		0.05     (0.17)</p>
<p>Total weighted average common shares and</p>
<p> common share equivalents		   10,192	5,081</p>
<p>Note: The company reported pro forma 1996 net income of $129,000, or $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>Pro forma net income was calculated assuming the company's 3.3 million share initial public offering and debt recapitalization of May 1, 1996 had been completed at the beginning of the first fiscal quarter of 1996, and is based on 8,893,000 average shares outstanding for the three month period ended April 30, 1996.</p>
